{"No-op updateMany call: updateManyByCredentialId(this.credential.id, {}) passes an empty data object {} to Prisma's updateMany. Prisma's @updatedAt directive only triggers when an actual field mutation occurs in the data payload. An empty data: {} produces a SQL UPDATE ... SET with no columns, which either no-ops or errors depending on the database driver \u2014 updatedAt will not be bumped. Fix by explicitly passing updatedAt: new Date() in the data object.": 0.9705287218093872}